{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-quality","title":"测试与质量保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/testing-quality","wordCount":812,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试与质量保障\">测试与质量保障</h1><p>微前端架构将一个应用拆成多个独立部署的单元，测试策略必须随之调整。传统单体应用的 E2E 测试可以覆盖所有交互路径；微前端中，每个子应用独立构建意味着「集成点」成为了新的脆弱面。本文按测试金字塔分层讲解微前端特有的测试策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微前端的测试金字塔需要在传统分层之上增加「集成边界测试」这一层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[E2E 测试 - 全链路] --&gt; B[集成边界测试]&#10;    B --&gt; C[子应用 E2E]&#10;    C --&gt; D[组件/单元测试]&#10;    A -.-&gt;|成本高/速度慢| A&#10;    D -.-&gt;|成本低/速度快| D\">graph TD\n    A[E2E 测试 - 全链路] --&gt; B[集成边界测试]\n    B --&gt; C[子应用 E2E]\n    C --&gt; D[组件/单元测试]\n    A -.-&gt;|成本高/速度慢| A\n    D -.-&gt;|成本低/速度快| D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试层</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>运行频率</th>\n<th>负责方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>子应用内部逻辑</td>\n<td>每次 commit</td>\n<td>子应用团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件测试</td>\n<td>子应用 UI 组件</td>\n<td>每次 commit</td>\n<td>子应用团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子应用 E2E</td>\n<td>子应用独立运行的完整流程</td>\n<td>每次 PR</td>\n<td>子应用团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成边界测试</td>\n<td>子应用与 Shell 的接口契约</td>\n<td>每次部署</td>\n<td>平台团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全链路 E2E</td>\n<td>多子应用协作的用户流程</td>\n<td>每日/每次发布</td>\n<td>QA 团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"子应用的独立测试\">子应用的独立测试</h2><p>每个子应用必须能够<strong>脱离 Shell 独立运行和测试</strong>。这是微前端可维护性的基石：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// product-app/vite.config.ts&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  // 独立开发模式：不依赖 Shell&#10;  server: { port: 3001 },&#10;  // 作为微前端模式：暴露 MF 模块&#10;  plugins: [&#10;    federation({&#10;      name: &#39;product&#39;,&#10;      exposes: { &#39;./ProductList&#39;: &#39;./src/components/ProductList&#39; },&#10;    }),&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// product-app/vite.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 独立开发模式：不依赖 Shell</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  server: { port: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 作为微前端模式：暴露 MF 模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  plugins: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    federation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      exposes: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./src/components/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>子应用的测试套件应覆盖：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>业务逻辑单元测试</strong>（Vitest）</li>\n<li><strong>组件渲染测试</strong>（Testing Library）</li>\n<li><strong>独立 E2E</strong>（Playwright，子应用独立启动）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"集成边界测试-contract-testing\">集成边界测试（Contract Testing）</h2><p>微前端之间的「契约」包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生命周期接口</strong>：bootstrap/mount/unmount 的调用时序</li>\n<li><strong>共享依赖版本</strong>：React/Vue 的 singleton 版本是否兼容</li>\n<li><strong>通信协议</strong>：事件名称、payload 结构</li>\n<li><strong>路由约定</strong>：URL 前缀分配</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// contract-tests/product.contract.test.ts&#10;import { describe, it, expect } from &#39;vitest&#39;;&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;Product App Contract&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;exports required lifecycle functions&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const app = await import(&#39;@product/app/single-spa-entry&#39;);&#10;    expect(app.bootstrap).toBeTypeOf(&#39;function&#39;);&#10;    expect(app.mount).toBeTypeOf(&#39;function&#39;);&#10;    expect(app.unmount).toBeTypeOf(&#39;function&#39;);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;mount returns a Promise&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const app = await import(&#39;@product/app/single-spa-entry&#39;);&#10;    const result = app.mount({ domElement: document.createElement(&#39;div&#39;) });&#10;    expect(result).toBeInstanceOf(Promise);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;declares compatible React version&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const pkg = require(&#39;@product/app/package.json&#39;);&#10;    const reactVersion = pkg.peerDependencies?.react || pkg.dependencies?.react;&#10;    expect(reactVersion).toMatch(/^\\^19/);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// contract-tests/product.contract.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { describe, it, expect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vitest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Product App Contract'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'exports required lifecycle functions'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@product/app/single-spa-entry'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(app.bootstrap).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeTypeOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(app.mount).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeTypeOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(app.unmount).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeTypeOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mount returns a Promise'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@product/app/single-spa-entry'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ domElement: document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'div'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeInstanceOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'declares compatible React version'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pkg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@product/app/package.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reactVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pkg.peerDependencies?.react </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pkg.dependencies?.react;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reactVersion).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toMatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\^</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">19</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"mf-2-0-的类型契约验证\">MF 2.0 的类型契约验证</h2><p>MF 2.0 的自动类型生成本身就是一种「编译时契约测试」——如果 Remote 修改了 exposed 模块的类型签名，Host 在构建时就会类型报错：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Host 中消费 Remote 模块&#10;import { ProductList } from &#39;product/ProductList&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 如果 Remote 的 ProductListProps 增加了必填字段&#10;// Host 编译会立即失败 → 类型契约破坏被提前发现&#10;&lt;ProductList category=&quot;electronics&quot; /&gt; // TS Error: missing required prop &#39;region&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Host 中消费 Remote 模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ProductList } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'product/ProductList'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 如果 Remote 的 ProductListProps 增加了必填字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Host 编译会立即失败 → 类型契约破坏被提前发现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ProductList category</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"electronics\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // TS Error: missing required prop 'region'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"全链路-e2e-测试\">全链路 E2E 测试</h2><p>多子应用协作的端到端测试需要在集成环境中运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// e2e/checkout-flow.spec.ts&#10;import { test, expect } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;test(&#39;complete checkout flow across micro-frontends&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  // 产品子应用：添加商品&#10;  await page.goto(&#39;/product/123&#39;);&#10;  await page.click(&#39;[data-testid=&quot;add-to-cart&quot;]&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 购物车子应用：确认商品&#10;  await page.click(&#39;[data-testid=&quot;cart-icon&quot;]&#39;);&#10;  await expect(page.locator(&#39;[data-testid=&quot;cart-count&quot;]&#39;)).toHaveText(&#39;1&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 结账子应用：完成支付&#10;  await page.click(&#39;[data-testid=&quot;checkout-btn&quot;]&#39;);&#10;  await page.fill(&#39;[data-testid=&quot;card-number&quot;]&#39;, &#39;4242424242424242&#39;);&#10;  await page.click(&#39;[data-testid=&quot;pay-btn&quot;]&#39;);&#10;  await expect(page.locator(&#39;[data-testid=&quot;success-msg&quot;]&#39;)).toBeVisible();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// e2e/checkout-flow.spec.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { test, expect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@playwright/test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'complete checkout flow across micro-frontends'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 产品子应用：添加商品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">goto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/product/123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">click</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[data-testid=\"add-to-cart\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 购物车子应用：确认商品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">click</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[data-testid=\"cart-icon\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">locator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[data-testid=\"cart-count\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toHaveText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 结账子应用：完成支付</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">click</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[data-testid=\"checkout-btn\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[data-testid=\"card-number\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4242424242424242'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">click</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[data-testid=\"pay-btn\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">locator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[data-testid=\"success-msg\"]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeVisible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 data-testid 作为跨团队的稳定选择器约定</li>\n<li>E2E 测试运行在<strong>集成环境</strong>（所有子应用真实部署）</li>\n<li>测试数据通过 API seed 而非 UI 操作准备</li>\n<li>失败时保存 trace + screenshot 便于跨团队排查</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"视觉回归测试\">视觉回归测试</h2><p>微前端场景下 CSS 冲突是高频问题，视觉回归测试是最后防线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// visual/product-list.visual.test.ts&#10;test(&#39;ProductList renders correctly in Shell context&#39;, async ({ page }) =&gt; {&#10;  await page.goto(&#39;/product&#39;);&#10;  await expect(page).toHaveScreenshot(&#39;product-list.png&#39;, {&#10;    maxDiffPixelRatio: 0.01,&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// visual/product-list.visual.test.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ProductList renders correctly in Shell context'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">goto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(page).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toHaveScreenshot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'product-list.png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    maxDiffPixelRatio: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配合 MF 2.0 的 Side Effect Scanner 检测 CSS 全局污染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 检测 Remote 模块的 CSS 副作用&#10;npx mf-scanner --entry ./dist/remoteEntry.js --check css-scope\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检测 Remote 模块的 CSS 副作用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mf-scanner</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --entry</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./dist/remoteEntry.js</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --check</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> css-scope</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"测试环境策略\">测试环境策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境类型</th>\n<th>子应用来源</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本地开发</td>\n<td>本地 + Mock 其他</td>\n<td>日常开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR Preview</td>\n<td>当前 PR + 线上稳定版</td>\n<td>代码评审</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成环境</td>\n<td>所有子应用最新 main</td>\n<td>集成验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预发环境</td>\n<td>与生产同配置</td>\n<td>最终验收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>每个子应用必须能脱离 Shell 独立测试</li>\n<li>集成边界测试覆盖生命周期、版本兼容、通信协议</li>\n<li>MF 2.0 的类型生成充当编译时契约验证</li>\n<li>全链路 E2E 在集成环境运行，data-testid 是跨团队约定</li>\n<li>视觉回归 + Side Effect Scanner 是 CSS 冲突的最后防线</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 前一篇：<a href=\"build-deploy-pipeline\">构建与部署流水线</a> — 测试依赖的 CI/CD 基础设施</li>\n<li>跨 hub 参考：<a href=\"../frontend-testing\">前端测试 hub</a> — 通用的前端测试策略与工具链</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试与质量保障","id":"测试与质量保障"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"子应用的独立测试","id":"子应用的独立测试"},{"level":2,"text":"集成边界测试（Contract Testing）","id":"集成边界测试-contract-testing"},{"level":2,"text":"MF 2.0 的类型契约验证","id":"mf-2-0-的类型契约验证"},{"level":2,"text":"全链路 E2E 测试","id":"全链路-e2e-测试"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉回归测试","id":"视觉回归测试"},{"level":2,"text":"测试环境策略","id":"测试环境策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"构建与部署流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/engineering/build-deploy-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-micro-frontends/operations/performance-optimization"}}